OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies demand answers over
OL,4,AVincent Chan complaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies affected by a former nursery
OL,7,Fworker who sexually abused young
OL,8,Fchildren in his care want an
OL,9,Finvestigation after learning he was
OL,10,Fallowed to return to work despite a
OL,11,Fcomplaint having been made against him.
OL,13,FVincent Chan, who worked at Bright
OL,14,FHorizons nursery on Finchley Road,
OL,15,Fnorth-west London, between 2017 and
OL,16,F2024, was jailed for 18 years in
OL,17,FFebruary after admitting 56 sexual
OL,18,Foffences.
OL,20,FConcerns about him were raised in 2021,
OL,21,Faccording to reports. The nature of the
OL,22,Fcomplaint has not been made public.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
